      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شنّق الخَلِيَّةَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْنِيقٌ</span>: see 1, in the latter
half of the paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْنِيقٌ</span> also signifies The
<i>cutting</i> [a thing] <i>in pieces.</i> (O, K. [See the
pass. part. n.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And The <i>adorning</i> [a person or
thing]. (K. [See 5.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also the next paragraph, near the end.

